  "goodToKnow": "Der Zutritt is access or admission: Zutritt verboten (no entry), Zutritt nur für Mitarbeiter (staff only), and on building sites, Unbefugten ist der Zutritt verboten (no unauthorised access). Sich Zutritt verschaffen means to gain entry. Close synonyms are der Zugang (access) and der Eintritt (entry, also the entrance fee). Literally, it's a step (Tritt) towards (zu). It has no plural."
